# Trivy ignore list. Same rules as the Dependency-Check suppressions:
# a reason, an owner and an expiry on every line. Expired entries stop
# being ignored automatically.
#
# Format: ID  exp:YYYY-MM-DD   # reason, owner, ticket

# Example (remove when there is a real one):
# CVE-2026-00000  exp:2027-01-31   # not reachable, only in test image layer. Smart. SEC-150
